  "guideContent": {
    "strategyOverview": "Esika, God of the Tree // The Prismatic Bridge is the strongest 5-color planeswalker commander ever printed. You cast the back side — a {1}{W}{U}{B}{R}{G} legendary enchantment that, every upkeep, reveals cards from the top of your library until it hits a creature or planeswalker, then drops that permanent onto the battlefield for free. The Prismatic Bridge is not a creature, so it dodges most spot removal and survives nearly every board wipe. With 19 permanents in the deck that qualify as hits (16 walkers + 14 creatures = 30 valid targets out of 63 spells), Bridge averages a ~50%+ free permanent every turn.\n\nThe deck plays as a Superfriends value pile that escalates into a combo finisher. Early turns deploy ramp (4 dorks + Sol Ring + Arcane Signet + 3 two-mana sorcery ramp + Chromatic Lantern + Faeburrow Elder = 11 ramp pieces) and stax-light draw engines (Rhystic Study, Mystic Remora, Smothering Tithe). Mid-game lands Esika, plus a counter-doubler (Doubling Season, Parallel Lives, Vorinclex, Deepglow Skate, ). The proliferate engine (Atraxa, Evolution Sage, Karn's Bastion, Tezzeret's Gambit, Inexorable Tide, Ichormoon Gauntlet, Vraska BS 0-ability) accelerates walker ultimates. Late-game closes via one of 10+ Commander Spellbook combo lines, the strongest being:\n\n  1. Doubling Season + Vraska, Betrayal's Sting — Vraska enters with 12 loyalty, ult immediately for 'you win the game'.\n  2. Doubling Season + Teferi, Temporal Archmage + The Chain Veil — emblem on ETB, then infinite walker activations.\n  3. Aetheric Amplifier + Teferi, Master of Time — Amp doubles Teferi's loyalty turn after turn for infinite extra turns.\n  4. Atraxa + Vraska, Betrayal's Sting — no Doubling Season needed; 1.5-turn poison kill.\n\nParadox Haze grants an extra upkeep step, doubling Bridge's free-walker trigger to TWO per turn. The Chain Veil + Oath of Teferi + Commodore Guff form a redundant 'activate walkers multiple times per turn' shell.\n\nBracket target: solid 3+ (loose B3 to B4-adjacent). Four Game Changers (Smothering Tithe, Fierce Guardianship, Cyclonic Rift, Rhystic Study). 10+ included combo lines per Spellbook. Threat assessment is real: expect to be archenemy'd by turn 4. Counter density (Counterspell, Swan Song, Fierce Guardianship, Mutational Advantage) + protection (Clever Concealment, Shalai, Plaza of Heroes, Heroic Intervention slot for future) is the survival tax.",
